data: [DO" cut after byte 25. The buffer after chunk 1 holds a partial line, so nothing happens yet. Then: the ping event ends and is ignored; the next event has two data lines, joined as {"delta":
"Hi"}, which is valid JSON, so text becomes "Hi"; then the bytes run out while "data: [DO" waits for its newline: status truncated, text "Hi", error null.

